    tolerance 1e-07   edge-slots moving over 4 permutations: 8
    tolerance 1e-08   edge-slots moving over 4 permutations: 0
    tolerance 1e-10   edge-slots moving over 4 permutations: 0
    tolerance 1e-11   edge-slots moving over 4 permutations: 8
    flip SET identity: unset == 1e-7: True ; rejected 1e-11 == unset: True ; 1e-8 == 1e-10 == empty: True
  A rejected value reproducing the DEFAULT's flip set exactly is the revert.

